From dba5cbfd6620b0b023de7ffda396c3fdc6b53270 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Liem Nguyen <liem.thanh.nguyen@mgm-tp.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 14:03:38 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add ClientSafetyEvent type for browser CNN collection

feat: add bulk safety event ingest endpoint

feat: add useBrowserCNN hook for client-side drowsiness detection

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

feat: add bulkIngestSafetyEvents API function

feat: wire useBrowserCNN into MyTripPage with webcam feed and live metrics

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

feat: remove MonitoringView page and route in favour of browser-side detection

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

fix: resolve lint errors in useBrowserCNN and MyTripPage

feat: add CLAUDE.md for project guidance and update detector script handling

- Create CLAUDE.md to provide instructions for shell commands, running services, verification, architecture, authentication, coding conventions, and key files.
- Update .gitignore to exclude error files (*.err).
- Refactor integrate_cnn_with_events.py for improved readability and maintainability, including argument parsing and safety event publishing.
- Enhance dev.sh script to check for required files and adjust detector backend based on OS.

fix: exclude TF.js and MediaPipe from Vite pre-bundling

fix: allow Vite to pre-bundle MediaPipe to avoid missing sourcemap error

chore: remove Python detector from dev scripts (replaced by browser CNN)

Refactor useBrowserCNN to use IIFE loaded TensorFlow, improve stream handling, and ensure proper disposal of tensors

- Updated TensorFlow import to use IIFE via script tag and declared it as a global variable.
- Changed model type references from `tf.LayersModel` to `TF.LayersModel`.
- Improved camera stream handling by using a dedicated reference for the MediaStream.
- Ensured proper disposal of tensors after predictions.
- Added Math.floor to duration_ms calculations for better accuracy.

Fix FleetPage score assignment to handle potential null values

- Updated score assignment logic to use optional chaining for safety.

Refactor MyTripPage to conditionally render CNN metrics and video

- Simplified rendering logic for live detection section based on cnnRunning state.
- Ensured that video and metrics are only displayed when CNN is running.

Remove TensorFlow from optimizeDeps in Vite config

- Removed TensorFlow exclusions from optimizeDeps as they are no longer necessary.

Update dev scripts to use virtual environment Python if available

- Modified PowerShell and Bash scripts to prioritize Python from the virtual environment if it exists.

chore: handoff
